<!--
  The themed-icon layer. Android 13 tints one silhouette to match the
  wallpaper, so there is no colour and no gradient to be had here: the
  shape has to carry it alone.

  Which is why the clasp is a hole rather than a lighter bar. A tinted
  bar on a tinted strap is one flat shape; cut out, it still reads as
  hardware on a band.
-->
